---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BudgetCalculator from '../../components/BudgetCalculator.astro';
---
<Layout title="套餐费用计算器" description="输入同一币种的账单金额和套餐周期，计算实际付款、月均成本及已知额度对应的理论成本。" crumbs={[{name:'预算工具',url:'/tools/'},{name:'套餐费用计算器',url:'/tools/cost/'}]}>
<div class="container"><div class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">BUDGET WITH CLEAR ASSUMPTIONS</span><h1>套餐费用计算器</h1><p>输入同一币种的账单金额和套餐周期，计算实际付款、月均成本及已知额度对应的理论成本。</p></div><BudgetCalculator kind="cost"><label class="budget-field" for="currency"><span>账单币种</span><select id="currency" name="currency"><option value="CNY">人民币 CNY</option><option value="USD">美元 USD</option><option value="HKD">港币 HKD</option><option value="TWD">新台币 TWD</option></select><small>仅标注结果，不进行汇率换算。</small></label><label class="budget-field" for="price"><span>套餐标价</span><input id="price" name="price" type="number" min="0" max="100000000" step="any" placeholder="例如 120" aria-describedby="price-help" required/><small id="price-help">填写本次周期总价，不是每月均价。</small></label><label class="budget-field" for="fees"><span>额外费用</span><input id="fees" name="fees" type="number" min="0" max="100000000" step="any" placeholder="例如 0" aria-describedby="fees-help" required/><small id="fees-help">同一币种的支付或渠道费用，没有则填 0。</small></label><label class="budget-field" for="discount"><span>优惠金额</span><input id="discount" name="discount" type="number" min="0" max="100000000" step="any" placeholder="例如 0" aria-describedby="discount-help" required/><small id="discount-help">填写实际减免金额，不填写优惠码或折扣百分比。</small></label><label class="budget-field" for="months"><span>覆盖月数</span><input id="months" name="months" type="number" min="0.01" max="1200" step="any" placeholder="例如 12" aria-describedby="months-help" required/><small id="months-help">按账单明确覆盖的月数填写；计算按月额度时须为整月。</small></label><label class="budget-field" for="reset"><span>额度规则</span><select id="reset" name="reset"><option value="monthly">每月重置相同额度</option><option value="total">整个周期共用一次额度</option></select><small>不能结转的月度额度只是理论合计，不等于随时可用。</small></label><label class="budget-field" for="quota"><span>额度（GB，可选）</span><input id="quota" name="quota" type="number" min="0.01" max="100000000" step="any" placeholder="未知或不限量请留空" aria-describedby="quota-help"/><small id="quota-help">按月重置填每月额度；总量套餐填整个周期额度。</small></label><label class="budget-field" for="multiplier"><span>统一倍率</span><input id="multiplier" name="multiplier" type="number" min="0.01" max="1000" step="any" placeholder="例如 1" aria-describedby="multiplier-help"/><small id="multiplier-help">计算额度时须填写；额度留空时可留空倍率。</small></label></BudgetCalculator><section class="budget-explainer"><h2>怎么算？</h2><p>实际付款 = 套餐标价 + 额外费用 − 优惠金额；月均成本 = 实际付款 ÷ 覆盖月数。按月重置的理论传输量 = 月额度 × 覆盖月数 ÷ 倍率；一次性总量 = 总额度 ÷ 倍率。</p><p>理论每 GB 成本 = 实际付款 ÷ 理论传输量。月均成本并不表示可以按月付款。混合倍率、额度不明确或不限量时，请留空额度，只计算账单成本。若价格已经是优惠后的实付价，优惠金额应填 0，避免重复减免。</p><p><a href="/tools/">返回预算工具</a> · <a href="/blog/plan-cost/">阅读计算口径与使用建议</a></p></section></div></Layout>